{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "type": "device",
  "name": "Transports en Commun Lyonnais",
  "description": {
    "en": "Next TCL departures, Vélo'v availability and park & ride occupancy in Lyon.",
    "fr": "Prochains passages TCL, disponibilités Vélo'v et places en parcs relais à Lyon."
  },
  "version": "2.1.1",
  "docker_image": "ghcr.io/prohand/gladys-transport-commun-lyonnais:2.1.1",
  "gladys_version": ">=5.1.0",
  "cover_image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/prohand/gladys-transport-commun-lyonnais/main/cover.png",
  "categories": ["environment"],
  "transports": ["cloud"],
  "config_schema": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "How it works",
        "fr": "Comment ça marche"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "This integration creates one read-only device per transit stop, Vélo'v station and park & ride you list below. Vélo'v works out of the box (open GBFS feed). Transit stops and park & ride read the TCL real-time datasets on Data Grand Lyon, which need a free account.",
        "fr": "Cette intégration crée un appareil en lecture seule par arrêt, station Vélo'v et parc relais listé ci-dessous. Vélo'v fonctionne sans rien configurer (flux GBFS ouvert). Les arrêts et les parcs relais lisent les jeux de données temps réel TCL sur Data Grand Lyon, qui nécessitent un compte gratuit."
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://data.grandlyon.com/portail/fr/jeux-de-donnees/prochains-passages-reseau-transports-commun-lyonnais-rhonexpress-disponibilites-temps-reel/info",
          "label": {
            "en": "TCL real-time departures dataset",
            "fr": "Jeu de données prochains passages TCL"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "https://data.grandlyon.com/portail/fr/jeux-de-donnees/parcs-relais-reseau-transports-commun-lyonnais-disponibilites-temps-reel/info",
          "label": {
            "en": "TCL park & ride dataset",
            "fr": "Jeu de données parcs relais TCL"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "https://transport.data.gouv.fr/datasets/velos-libre-service-lyon-velov-disponibilite-en-temps-reel",
          "label": {
            "en": "Vélo'v GBFS feed",
            "fr": "Flux GBFS Vélo'v"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "account",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "Data Grand Lyon account",
        "fr": "Compte Data Grand Lyon"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "You sign in on data.grandlyon.com with GrandLyon Connect, but the API needs a separate password that you set on the data platform itself. If its profile page asks for an old password you never had, log out of the portal and use its forgotten-password link. Leave both fields empty if you only watch Vélo'v stations.",
        "fr": "Vous vous connectez à data.grandlyon.com avec GrandLyon Connect, mais l'API exige un mot de passe distinct, à définir sur la plateforme de données. Si sa page de profil réclame un ancien mot de passe que vous n'avez jamais eu, déconnectez-vous du portail et utilisez son lien « Mot de passe oublié ? ». Laissez les deux champs vides si vous ne surveillez que des stations Vélo'v."
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://moncompte.grandlyon.com/login/",
          "label": {
            "en": "Create a GrandLyon Connect account",
            "fr": "Créer un compte GrandLyon Connect"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "https://data.grandlyon.com/onegeo-login/fr/profile/",
          "label": {
            "en": "Set the data platform password",
            "fr": "Définir le mot de passe de la plateforme"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "grandlyon_username",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Data Grand Lyon login",
        "fr": "Identifiant Data Grand Lyon"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The login of your data platform account — in general the email address of your GrandLyon Connect account.",
        "fr": "L'identifiant de votre compte sur la plateforme de données — en général l'adresse email de votre compte GrandLyon Connect."
      },
      "required": false,
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "you@example.com",
        "fr": "vous@exemple.com"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "grandlyon_password",
      "type": "secret",
      "label": {
        "en": "Data platform password",
        "fr": "Mot de passe de la plateforme"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The password you defined on data.grandlyon.com/onegeo-login/fr/profile/, NOT your GrandLyon Connect password.",
        "fr": "Le mot de passe défini sur data.grandlyon.com/onegeo-login/fr/profile/, PAS votre mot de passe GrandLyon Connect."
      },
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "key": "watch",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "What to watch",
        "fr": "Ce que vous voulez surveiller"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Separate entries with commas or newlines. Use the buttons at the bottom of this screen to look up the identifiers without leaving Gladys.",
        "fr": "Séparez les entrées par des virgules ou des retours à la ligne. Utilisez les boutons en bas de cet écran pour retrouver les identifiants sans quitter Gladys."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "stops",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Transit stops",
        "fr": "Arrêts"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Stop identifiers. Optional line filter after @ and custom name after : — e.g. \"1234, 5678@T1:Tram at home, 4321@C3|C13\".",
        "fr": "Identifiants d'arrêt. Filtre de lignes optionnel après @ et nom personnalisé après : — ex. « 1234, 5678@T1:Tram en bas, 4321@C3|C13 »."
      },
      "required": false,
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "1234, 5678@T1:Tram at home",
        "fr": "1234, 5678@T1:Tram en bas"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "velov_stations",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Vélo'v stations",
        "fr": "Stations Vélo'v"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Station identifiers or names, with an optional custom name after : — e.g. \"10063, Hotel de Ville:Work\".",
        "fr": "Identifiants ou noms de stations, avec un nom personnalisé optionnel après : — ex. « 10063, Hotel de Ville:Bureau »."
      },
      "required": false,
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "10063, Hotel de Ville:Work",
        "fr": "10063, Hotel de Ville:Bureau"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "park_and_ride",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Park & ride (P+R)",
        "fr": "Parcs relais (P+R)"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Park & ride identifiers or names, with an optional custom name after : — e.g. \"Gorge de Loup, Parilly:Commute\".",
        "fr": "Identifiants ou noms de parcs relais, avec un nom personnalisé optionnel après : — ex. « Gorge de Loup, Parilly:Trajet boulot »."
      },
      "required": false,
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "Gorge de Loup, Parilly:Commute",
        "fr": "Gorge de Loup, Parilly:Trajet boulot"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "refresh",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "Refresh intervals",
        "fr": "Fréquences de rafraîchissement"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Each device is refreshed by Gladys at its own interval. The upstream feeds are recomputed about once a minute, so polling faster only costs requests.",
        "fr": "Chaque appareil est rafraîchi par Gladys à son propre intervalle. Les flux sources sont recalculés environ toutes les minutes : interroger plus souvent ne fait que consommer des requêtes."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "departures_poll_frequency",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Departures refresh interval (s)",
        "fr": "Rafraîchissement des passages (s)"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "How often the next departures of each watched stop are refreshed, in seconds.",
        "fr": "Fréquence de rafraîchissement des prochains passages de chaque arrêt surveillé, en secondes."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": 60,
      "min": 30,
      "max": 3600
    },
    {
      "key": "velov_poll_frequency",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Vélo'v refresh interval (s)",
        "fr": "Rafraîchissement Vélo'v (s)"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "How often bike and dock availability is refreshed, in seconds.",
        "fr": "Fréquence de rafraîchissement des vélos et places disponibles, en secondes."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": 120,
      "min": 30,
      "max": 3600
    },
    {
      "key": "park_and_ride_poll_frequency",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Park & ride refresh interval (s)",
        "fr": "Rafraîchissement parcs relais (s)"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "How often park & ride occupancy is refreshed, in seconds.",
        "fr": "Fréquence de rafraîchissement de l'occupation des parcs relais, en secondes."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": 300,
      "min": 30,
      "max": 3600
    },
    {
      "key": "max_departures",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Departures per stop",
        "fr": "Passages par arrêt"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "How many upcoming departures each stop device exposes as features.",
        "fr": "Nombre de prochains passages exposés en fonctionnalités par arrêt."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": 3,
      "min": 1,
      "max": 5
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "key": "test_grandlyon",
      "label": {
        "en": "Test the Data Grand Lyon account",
        "fr": "Tester le compte Data Grand Lyon"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 90
    },
    {
      "key": "search_stops",
      "label": {
        "en": "Find a transit stop",
        "fr": "Chercher un arrêt"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 90,
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "query",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Stop name",
            "fr": "Nom de l'arrêt"
          },
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "Bellecour",
            "fr": "Bellecour"
          },
          "required": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "search_velov_stations",
      "label": {
        "en": "Find a Vélo'v station",
        "fr": "Chercher une station Vélo'v"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 30,
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "query",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Station name",
            "fr": "Nom de la station"
          },
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "Hotel de Ville",
            "fr": "Hotel de Ville"
          },
          "required": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "list_park_and_ride",
      "label": {
        "en": "List the park & ride facilities",
        "fr": "Lister les parcs relais"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 60
    }
  ],
  "scene_triggers": [
    {
      "key": "departure_approaching",
      "label": {
        "en": "TCL departure approaching",
        "fr": "Passage TCL imminent"
      },
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "stop",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Transit stop",
            "fr": "Arrêt"
          },
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "threshold",
          "type": "select",
          "label": {
            "en": "Minutes before departure",
            "fr": "Minutes avant le passage"
          },
          "required": true,
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "1",
              "label": {
                "en": "1 minute",
                "fr": "1 minute"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "2",
              "label": {
                "en": "2 minutes",
                "fr": "2 minutes"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "3",
              "label": {
                "en": "3 minutes",
                "fr": "3 minutes"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "5",
              "label": {
                "en": "5 minutes",
                "fr": "5 minutes"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "10",
              "label": {
                "en": "10 minutes",
                "fr": "10 minutes"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "15",
              "label": {
                "en": "15 minutes",
                "fr": "15 minutes"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "line",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Line (empty: any)",
            "fr": "Ligne (vide : toutes)"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "As written on the vehicle, e.g. T1 or C3 — upper case included.",
            "fr": "Telle qu’affichée sur le véhicule, ex. T1 ou C3 — majuscules comprises."
          },
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "T1",
            "fr": "T1"
          }
        }
      ],
      "variables": [
        {
          "key": "stop_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Stop",
            "fr": "Arrêt"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "line",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Line",
            "fr": "Ligne"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "direction",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Direction",
            "fr": "Direction"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "minutes",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Minutes to wait",
            "fr": "Minutes d’attente"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "realtime",
          "type": "boolean",
          "label": {
            "en": "Real-time tracked",
            "fr": "Suivi en temps réel"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "velov_station_changed",
      "label": {
        "en": "Vélo'v availability changed",
        "fr": "Disponibilité Vélo'v"
      },
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "station",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Vélo'v station",
            "fr": "Station Vélo'v"
          },
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "event",
          "type": "multi_select",
          "label": {
            "en": "Events (empty: any)",
            "fr": "Événements (vide : tous)"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "no_bike",
              "label": {
                "en": "Last bike taken",
                "fr": "Plus aucun vélo"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "bikes_back",
              "label": {
                "en": "Bikes available again",
                "fr": "Vélos de nouveau disponibles"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "no_dock",
              "label": {
                "en": "No free dock left",
                "fr": "Plus aucune place libre"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "docks_back",
              "label": {
                "en": "Docks free again",
                "fr": "Places de nouveau libres"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "out_of_service",
              "label": {
                "en": "Station out of service",
                "fr": "Station hors service"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "back_in_service",
              "label": {
                "en": "Station back in service",
                "fr": "Station remise en service"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variables": [
        {
          "key": "station_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Station",
            "fr": "Station"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "event",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Event",
            "fr": "Événement"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "bikes",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Bikes available",
            "fr": "Vélos disponibles"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "electric_bikes",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Electric bikes available",
            "fr": "Vélos électriques disponibles"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "docks",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Docks available",
            "fr": "Places disponibles"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "park_and_ride_changed",
      "label": {
        "en": "Park & ride availability",
        "fr": "Disponibilité parc relais"
      },
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "facility",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Park & ride",
            "fr": "Parc relais"
          },
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "event",
          "type": "multi_select",
          "label": {
            "en": "Events (empty: any)",
            "fr": "Événements (vide : tous)"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "almost_full",
              "label": {
                "en": "Almost full (90 %)",
                "fr": "Presque complet (90 %)"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "full",
              "label": {
                "en": "Full",
                "fr": "Complet"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "spaces_back",
              "label": {
                "en": "Spaces available again",
                "fr": "Places de nouveau disponibles"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variables": [
        {
          "key": "facility_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Park & ride",
            "fr": "Parc relais"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "event",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Event",
            "fr": "Événement"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "available",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Free spaces",
            "fr": "Places libres"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "capacity",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Capacity",
            "fr": "Capacité"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "occupancy",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Occupancy (%)",
            "fr": "Remplissage (%)"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "scene_actions": [
    {
      "key": "get_next_departures",
      "label": {
        "en": "Read the next departures",
        "fr": "Lire les prochains passages"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 60,
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "stop",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Transit stop",
            "fr": "Arrêt"
          },
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "line",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Line (empty: any)",
            "fr": "Ligne (vide : toutes)"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Only this line, e.g. T1 or C3.",
            "fr": "Seulement cette ligne, ex. T1 ou C3."
          },
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "T1",
            "fr": "T1"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "stop_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Stop",
            "fr": "Arrêt"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "line",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Line",
            "fr": "Ligne"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "direction",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Direction",
            "fr": "Direction"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "minutes",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Minutes to wait",
            "fr": "Minutes d’attente"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "realtime",
          "type": "boolean",
          "label": {
            "en": "Real-time tracked",
            "fr": "Suivi en temps réel"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "departure",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Next departure",
            "fr": "Prochain passage"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "following_minutes",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Minutes to the following one",
            "fr": "Minutes jusqu’au suivant"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "summary",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Departure board",
            "fr": "Tableau des passages"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "count",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Upcoming departures",
            "fr": "Passages à venir"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "get_velov_station",
      "label": {
        "en": "Read a Vélo'v station",
        "fr": "Lire une station Vélo'v"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 30,
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "station",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Vélo'v station",
            "fr": "Station Vélo'v"
          },
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "station_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Station",
            "fr": "Station"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "bikes",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Bikes available",
            "fr": "Vélos disponibles"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "electric_bikes",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Electric bikes available",
            "fr": "Vélos électriques disponibles"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "docks",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Docks available",
            "fr": "Places disponibles"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "occupancy",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
            "en": "Occupancy (%)",
            "fr": "Remplissage (%)"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "status",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Status",
            "fr": "État"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "get_park_and_ride",
      "label": {
        "en": "Read a park & ride",
        "fr": "Lire un parc relais"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 60,
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "facility",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Park & ride",
            "fr": "Parc relais"
          },
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "facility_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Park & ride",
            "fr": "Parc relais"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "available",
          "type": "number",
          "label": {
